{"id":"6c6cad39792d5f33","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-beth.md","title":"A Fixed Point Obtained by Beth Definability","display":"thm-fixed-point-beth — A Fixed Point Obtained by Beth Definability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-beth","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-beth"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-fixed-point-beth — A Fixed Point Obtained by Beth Definability","depends_on":["[[89-thm-beth-definability]]","[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-beth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-beth</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-beth — A Fixed Point Obtained by Beth Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae10ea6d3d0420ac\" href=\"?note=ae10ea6d3d0420ac\" title=\"89-thm-beth-definability\">89-thm-beth-definability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"251691cede4cbc3e\" href=\"?note=251691cede4cbc3e\" title=\"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness\">89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0b83ca065132609\" href=\"?note=a0b83ca065132609\" title=\"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point\">89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为原书加强且不添加字母的不动点谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}beth}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}beth}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 122；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\ne p\">\\(q\\ne p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(D=\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D&#39;=\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A[p:=q])\">\\(D&#39;=\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A[p:=q])\\)</span>。Bernardi 引理的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=p\">\\(B=p\\)</span> 实例给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\land D&#39;\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q)\">\\(D\\land D&#39;\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q)\\)</span> 可证。Beth 定理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>、字母仅来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\">\\(D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\)</span> 可证；Goldfarb 判据升级为完整 dotted-box 等价，正是 BookFix。\n这条第三种存在证明的依赖链先证重命名唯一性，再证存在，不回引一般不动点存在定理。它不给构造度数界；需要有效有界公式时使用 character 或单字母迹算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-thm-beth-definability","status":"resolved","id":"ae10ea6d3d0420ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-beth-definability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}beth}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H).","display":true},{"tex":"q\\ne p","display":false},{"tex":"q\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)","display":false},{"tex":"D'=\\Box^+(q\\leftrightarrow A[p:=q])","display":false},{"tex":"B=p","display":false},{"tex":"D\\land D'\\to(p\\leftrightarrow q)","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"D\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)","display":false}],"bytes":1515,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"第三种存在证明：[[89-df-inseparable-pair]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-extension]] → [[89-lem-inseparable-box-witness]] → [[89-thm-craig-interpolation]] → [[89-thm-beth-definability]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-beth]]。"}],"outgoing":["ae10ea6d3d0420ac","251691cede4cbc3e","a0b83ca065132609","85e306b51d3267ec"]}